/li><li>Uncontested Divorce</li><li>Contested Divorce</li><li>Child Custody</li><li>Child Support</li><li>Alimony</li><li>Property Division</li><li>Paternity</li><li>Military Divorce</li></ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-c586f94\" data-eae-slider=\"91828\" data-id=\"c586f94\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5dc3fc5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5dc3fc5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps?cid=16305971269658752943\"><b>The Drake Law Firm, PC</b></a><br /><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps?cid=16305971269658752943\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2117 Ford St</span></a><br /><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps?cid=16305971269658752943\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Golden, CO 80401</span></a><br /><a href=\"tel:+17206798813\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">(720) 679-8813</span></a></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-2a71f1d3 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"39001\" data-id=\"2a71f1d3\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-5efa3582\" data-eae-slider=\"37788\" data-id=\"5efa3582\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1ad8afe elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1ad8afe\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Ratings for<br>\nThe Drake Law Firm, PC</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5f27886 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"5f27886\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a2263d5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a2263d5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=The+Drake+Law+Firm,+PC+Reviews&amp;si=AMgyJEtREmoPL4P1I5IDCfuA8gybfVI2d5Uj7QMwYCZHKDZ-E_NvWFffH91qiOGnwCRGn_otmMEanYs-TruJw-6uDIhY5rSo7kOIKth2k9GiO0FyPu9zHjBUDe8ZeVmipbQYY1yFDthGpqeF9mkVv1pZ-XzDe7jogw%3D%3D\">Read Client Reviews</a></strong></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-f81d491\" data-eae-slider=\"36041\" data-id=\"f81d491\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9d672a3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"9d672a3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3067.588959560754!2d-105.21405022439795!3d39.748883096016584!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x407010d54937d6b3%3A0xe24a727a1dbc37af!2sThe%20Drake%20Law%20Firm%2C%20PC!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sus!4v1770245330395!5m2!1sen!2sus\" width=\"100%\" height=\"300\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-ab3007a elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"49008\" data-id=\"ab3007a\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-c3f7415\" data-eae-slider=\"1696\" data-id=\"c3f7415\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-988dc3e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"988dc3e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">About The Drake Law Firm, PC\n</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-956f290 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"956f290\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">At <a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/\">The Drake Law Firm, PC</a>, we provide focused family law services to the Golden, Colorado community and clients throughout Jefferson County. We understand that legal issues involving your family are deeply personal and often stressful. Our practice is centered on providing a blend of high-level legal skill and genuine, compassionate support for every client we serve.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-14af4a7 elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"14af4a7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm elementor-animation-grow\" href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/contact-us/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Talk to a Golden Family Attorney Today</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1733df8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1733df8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">The Difference Family Law Focus Makes\n</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c1e36bd elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c1e36bd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Our firm exclusively practices family law—this isn&#8217;t a side practice or secondary focus. This focus means we understand Colorado&#8217;s family law statutes with exceptional depth and stay current with every legislative change. While general practice attorneys might handle a divorce case occasionally, our team lives and breathes family law daily. This knowledge translates to more efficient case management, sharper strategic thinking, and ultimately better outcomes for you and your family.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1159be1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1159be1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Comprehensive Family Law Services</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2c3d46a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2c3d46a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We guide clients in Golden, CO through all aspects of family law. Our practice includes divorce representation across all approaches such as  collaborative divorce for couples seeking cooperative solutions, mediation for structured negotiation, and full litigation preparation when courtroom advocacy becomes necessary. We handle both uncontested divorces where agreements exist and contested matters requiring strategic negotiation or trial.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Colorado uses the term &#8220;parenting time&#8221; for custody arrangements, and we help parents develop plans that serve their children&#8217;s best interests while protecting parental rights. This includes initial custody determinations during divorce, modifications when circumstances change, and relocation cases when one parent plans to move.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Our team also manages child support calculations and disputes, spousal maintenance (alimony) negotiations, property and debt division in divorces of all asset levels, paternity establishment, military divorce with its unique federal and state law considerations, and enforcement actions when court orders aren&#8217;t being followed. If you need to modify an existing order due to changed circumstances, we handle those proceedings as well.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4a5c30f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4a5c30f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">How Our Team Approaches Your Case</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-49bcbbb elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"49bcbbb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Experience can make all the difference in family law. O<span class=\"citation-77\">ur </span><a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/colorado/divorce/\"><span class=\"citation-77\">divorce services in Golden</span></a><span class=\"citation-77 citation-end-77\"> bring</span> substantial courtroom and negotiation background to each case. We understand that effective representation requires both legal skill and strategic thinking—knowing when settlement serves your interests and when courtroom advocacy becomes essential.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">What distinguishes our approach is the time we invest in understanding your specific situation before developing strategy. A parenting plan that works for one family may be entirely wrong for another. A property division approach suitable for a couple with simple assets doesn&#8217;t apply to cases involving business interests or complex retirement accounts. We ask detailed questions about your priorities, your concerns, and your goals for post-divorce life because those answers shape everything we do.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We&#8217;ve also built working relationships throughout the Jefferson County legal community with mediators, parenting evaluators, financial experts, and other professionals who frequently contribute to family law cases. These connections benefit our clients across <a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/colorado/locations/\">all locations we serve</a> when we need to bring in specialized expertise.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-11409d2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"11409d2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Take the First Step</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4ddac16 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4ddac16\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/contact-us/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Schedule a consultation</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> with one of <a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/colorado/attorneys/\">our Golden family law attorneys</a>. We&#8217;ll listen to your story, answer your questions, and explain how we can help you move forward. Whether you&#8217;re considering divorce, facing a custody matter, or dealing with another family law issue, we&#8217;re here to provide the professional, compassionate representation you need.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-10997b1 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"48823\" data-id=\"10997b1\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-791a97b\" data-eae-slider=\"29309\" data-id=\"791a97b\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d22af16 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"d22af16\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Directions to Our Golden Office\n</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5ad07ad elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5ad07ad\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/colorado/locations/\">Our office</a> is conveniently located in Golden, with easy access for clients from Arvada, Wheat Ridge, Morrison, Evergreen, and throughout Jefferson County. We are situated near the Jefferson County Courthouse. </span><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir//2117+Ford+St,+Golden,+CO+80401,+United+States/@39.7488499,-105.2938762,12z/data=!4m8!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x407010d54937d6b3:0xe24a727a1dbc37af!2m2!1d-105.2114753!2d39.748879?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAxNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Click here for directions using Google Maps</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9bc61cb elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9bc61cb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>Where to Park</b></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ample visitor parking is available in the lot adjacent to our building, providing convenient access to our suite.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b1f5a12 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"b1f5a12\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">How to Get to Our Golden Office:</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a52a506 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a52a506\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>Coming from Apple Meadows</b></p><ol><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Head east on W 61st Place and turn right onto Crestone Street</span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Turn right onto W 58th Avenue and continue for about 0.7 miles</span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Use any lane to turn left onto CO-93 South and follow for approximately 1.7 miles</span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Turn left onto Pine Ridge Road, then immediately turn right onto N Ford Street</span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Continue on N Ford Street for about 1.9 miles (the road becomes Jackson Street after passing Burger King)</span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> At the traffic circle, take the fifth exit to continue on Ford Street</span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Turn right onto 22nd Street, then make a left turn</span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> The office will be on your left at 2117 Ford Street, Golden, CO 80401</span></li></ol><p> </p><p><b>Coming from Applewood</b></p><ol><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Head east and turn left onto Indiana Street</span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Turn left onto W 32nd Avenue and continue for approximately 3.2 miles</span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Continue straight as the road becomes 13th Street, then turn left onto East Street</span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Follow East Street for about half a mile, then turn right onto 21st Street</span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Make a left turn &#8211; the office will be on your right at 2117 Ford Street, Golden, CO 80401</span></li></ol><p> </p><p><b>Coming from Genesee</b></p><ol><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Head northeast on Genesee Ridge Road toward Meadowrose Drive for about 1.9 miles</span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Turn left, then immediately turn right to merge onto I-70 East</span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Stay on I-70 East for approximately 3 miles, then take exit 260 toward US-6 West/6th Avenue</span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Merge onto CO-470 West and continue for about 0.4 miles</span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Take the US-6 East exit toward 6th Avenue</span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Continue straight onto Johnson Road for about 1.2 miles</span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> At the first traffic circle, take the third exit onto S Golden Road</span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> At the next traffic circle, take the second exit onto Ford Street</span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Turn right onto 22nd Street, then make a left turn</span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> The office will be on your left at 2117 Ford Street, Golden, CO 80401</span></li></ol>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-8ebec79 elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"84533\" data-id=\"8ebec79\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-b46b88d\" data-eae-slider=\"92786\" data-id=\"b46b88d\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-117fac6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"117fac6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Golden Family Law Attorney FAQs</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8378f84 elementor-widget elementor-widget-accordion\" data-id=\"8378f84\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 id=\"elementor-tab-title-1371\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"1\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1371\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-left\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">How can a Golden family law attorney help me with divorce or custody?</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1371\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-1371\"><p>A Golden family law attorney assists clients with legal matters that affect their families, including divorce, child custody, parenting plans, child support, and dividing property. At The Drake Law Firm, we work closely with clients to understand their goals and take practical steps to protect their future. Whether you’re starting a divorce, adjusting custody arrangements, or handling support issues, a family lawyer guides you through your rights, paperwork, and agreements.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 id=\"elementor-tab-title-1372\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1372\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-left\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">Will I need to appear in court for a family law case in Golden?</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1372\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-1372\"><p>Not every family law case in Golden requires an in-person court appearance. Most cases start with a virtual Initial Status Conference. Many matters, such as custody schedules, support agreements, or property division, can often be resolved through negotiation or mediation. If both parties cooperate, your Golden family law attorney can help create legally binding agreements without stepping into a courtroom. If disputes arise, your lawyer is ready to represent you at hearings to protect your interests.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 id=\"elementor-tab-title-1373\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"3\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1373\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-left\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">What is the timeline for getting a divorce in Colorado?</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1373\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-1373\"><p>Colorado requires a 91-day waiting period before a divorce can be finalized, beginning after your spouse is served or immediately if you file jointly. Beyond this mandatory period, the divorce timeline depends on how quickly you and your spouse reach agreements on issues like child custody, support, and property division. A Golden family lawyer can help ensure your case moves efficiently and all legal requirements are handled correctly.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 id=\"elementor-tab-title-1374\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"4\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1374\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-left\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">What if my spouse and I already agree on all divorce terms?</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1374\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"4\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-1374\"><p>If both spouses agree on parenting schedules, asset division, and support, you can submit your settlement to the court for approval. This is called an uncontested divorce. Uncontested divorces in Golden are generally faster and more affordable than contested cases. A Golden family law attorney will review your financial disclosures, parenting plan, and agreements to ensure everything meets Colorado law, then file the necessary documents to finalize your divorce smoothly.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 id=\"elementor-tab-title-1375\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"5\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1375\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-left\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">Can child custody or support orders be changed in later?</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1375\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"5\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-1375\"><p>Yes. Custody and child support orders can be modified in Golden if circumstances change, such as a job loss, relocation, or changes in a child’s needs. To request a modification, you must show that the new situation significantly affects the original order. A Golden family law attorney can help prepare and file your request and advocate for adjustments that reflect your current reality.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How can a Golden family law attorney help me with divorce or custody?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"<p>A Golden family law attorney assists clients with legal matters that affect their families, including divorce, child custody, parenting plans, child support, and dividing property. At The Drake Law Firm, we work closely with clients to understand their goals and take practical steps to protect their future. Whether you\\u2019re starting a divorce, adjusting custody arrangements, or handling support issues, a family lawyer guides you through your rights, paperwork, and agreements.<\\/p>\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Will I need to appear in court for a family law case in Golden?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"<p>Not every family law case in Golden requires an in-person court appearance. Most cases start with a virtual Initial Status Conference. Many matters, such as custody schedules, support agreements, or property division, can often be resolved through negotiation or mediation. If both parties cooperate, your Golden family law attorney can help create legally binding agreements without stepping into a courtroom. If disputes arise, your lawyer is ready to represent you at hearings to protect your interests.<\\/p>\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the timeline for getting a divorce in Colorado?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"<p>Colorado requires a 91-day waiting period before a divorce can be finalized, beginning after your spouse is served or immediately if you file jointly. Beyond this mandatory period, the divorce timeline depends on how quickly you and your spouse reach agreements on issues like child custody, support, and property division. A Golden family lawyer can help ensure your case moves efficiently and all legal requirements are handled correctly.<\\/p>\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What if my spouse and I already agree on all divorce terms?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"<p>If both spouses agree on parenting schedules, asset division, and support, you can submit your settlement to the court for approval. This is called an uncontested divorce. Uncontested divorces in Golden are generally faster and more affordable than contested cases. A Golden family law attorney will review your financial disclosures, parenting plan, and agreements to ensure everything meets Colorado law, then file the necessary documents to finalize your divorce smoothly.<\\/p>\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can child custody or support orders be changed in later?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"<p>Yes. Custody and child support orders can be modified in Golden if circumstances change, such as a job loss, relocation, or changes in a child\\u2019s needs. To request a modification, you must show that the new situation significantly affects the original order. A Golden family law attorney can help prepare and file your request and advocate for adjustments that reflect your current reality.<\\/p>\"}}]}</script>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-8bd6db3 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"62389\" data-id=\"8bd6db3\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-a30bdb0\" data-eae-slider=\"80408\" data-id=\"a30bdb0\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9f72d03 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"9f72d03\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div cla